Usage: gccli activity retype --type-id=INT --type-key=FREE-TEXT <id> [flags]

Change activity type.

Arguments:
  <id>    Activity ID.

Flags:
  -h, --help                  Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json                  Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain                 Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
